# New audio is ignored by default so nothing is published by accident. Tracks whose licence is confirmed are added on purpose with `git add -f`.
# Files already tracked stay tracked. Duplicates moved out of the library (_removed/) are never committed.
music-library/_removed/
music-library/**/*.mp3
music-library/**/*.wav
music-library/**/*.m4a
music-library/**/*.flac
music-library/**/*.ogg
music-library/incoming/
music-library/.features-cache.json
music-library/review.html
